      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)**Use** each loose support item on the hot cauldron to offer it safely; sneak-use remains the gesture for stirring a dual-purpose custom-brew ingredient. Use the named trigger last.[#]()",
